                  "text": "16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe Yoramu yaagaruka Yezereeli kurwarizibwayo obuhuta obu Abasiria baamuhutaariize Raama, obu yaarwana na Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria. Kandi Ahazia mwene Yehoraamu omugabe wa Yuda yaashuuma kureeba Yoramu mwene Ahabu omuri Yezereeli, ahabw'okuba akaba arwaire.",
          "type": "text",
